<title>USA: Boomtown gets OK for Hollywood.</title>
<headline>Boomtown gets OK for Hollywood.</headline>
<dateline>RENO, Nev 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boomtown Inc said Louisiana gaming authorities approved the company's proposed merger with Hollywood Park Inc.</p>
<p>With receipt of such approval, the remaining conditions to completion of the Hart-Scott-Rodino approval, which its expects to obtain on an expedited basis, and the consent of the holders of at least a majority in principal amount of the Company's 11.5 percent of First Mortgage Notes due 2003.</p>
</text>
